#ASSERT `s 90 the benefit is abolished by the repeal of sections 71 to 76 of the Contributions and Benefits Act` `personal independence payment` EQUALS NOTHING
#ASSERT `s 90 the benefit is abolished by the repeal of sections 71 to 76 of the Contributions and Benefits Act` `universal credit` EQUALS NOTHING
